ry":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and January to February came in under 90% of normal in 38 of those 75 years. In 2026 so far, the middle of the grids had March to April at 54% of normal and April to May at 57%. June to July is the wettest pair at 5.67 inches normal, and grid 34609 had its driest year in 1961 at 56% of normal.</p>"}
